      {
        "id": 1760333770042.669,
        "title": "<span style=\"word-break: break-word;\"><font color=\"#b28dff\">Admin panel</font></span><b><font color=\"#b28dff\" style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\"> - </font></b><span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\">function</span><span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\"> </span><span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\"><font color=\"#b28dff\">navigateTo</font></span><span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\">(</span><span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\">pageId</span><span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\">)</span>",
        "content": "<div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\">1. The <span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font color=\"#b28dff\">page is defined by localstorage value</font>.</span></div><div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\"><div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\"><div style=\"line-height: 19px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\"><div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\"><span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\"><div style=\"line-height: 19px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\"><div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(121, 192, 255); overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\"></span><span class=\"inline-code hljs language-javascript\"><span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">localStorage</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">setItem</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">'lastVisitedPage'</span>,&nbsp;pageId);</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\"><font color=\"#7b88a1\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\"></font></span></div></div></span></div><div style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: &quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;, &quot;monospace&quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(123, 136, 161); overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\"><br style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\"></div><div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\"><span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\"><span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\"><span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\">2. Get user status, logged, admin or testuser from&nbsp;</span></span></span><font color=\"#b28dff\">checkAuthStatus</font> function.</div><div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\"><span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\"><div style=\"line-height: 19px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\"><div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 123, 114); overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\"></span><span class=\"inline-code hljs language-csharp\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span>&nbsp;authStatus&nbsp;=&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span>&nbsp;checkAuthStatus(<span class=\"hljs-literal\">false</span>);</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\"></span></div><div style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(123, 136, 161); font-family: &quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;, &quot;monospace&quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\"><br></div><div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\"><span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\"></span></div><div style=\"display: inline-block; padding-left: 2em;\"><div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\"><span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\"><b>checkAuthStatus signature</b>&nbsp;</span></div><div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\"><span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\">{&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(230, 237, 243); font-family: &quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;, &quot;monospace&quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\">loggedIn</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 123, 114); font-family: &quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;, &quot;monospace&quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\">:</span><span style=\"color: rgb(123, 136, 161); font-family: &quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;, &quot;monospace&quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(121, 192, 255); font-family: &quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;, &quot;monospace&quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\">any</span><span style=\"color: rgb(123, 136, 161); font-family: &quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;, &quot;monospace&quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\">;</span></div><div style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(123, 136, 161); font-family: &quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;, &quot;monospace&quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\"><span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\">    </span><span style=\"color: rgb(230, 237, 243); overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\">isAdmin</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 123, 114); overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\">:</span><span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(121, 192, 255); overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\">any</span><span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\">;</span></div><div style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(123, 136, 161); font-family: &quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;, &quot;monospace&quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\"><span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\">    </span><span style=\"color: rgb(230, 237, 243); overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\">isTestuser</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 123, 114); overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\">:</span><span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(121, 192, 255); overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\">any</span><span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\">; </span></div><div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\"><span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\">}</span></div></div><div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\"><span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\"></span></div><div style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(123, 136, 161); font-family: &quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;, &quot;monospace&quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\"><br></div></div></span></div></div></div><div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\"><span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\">3. Check if is authenticated,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">if not return error.</span></div><div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\"><br></div><div style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-word;\">4. Check if want access `adminPanel` page and if is admin.&nbsp;<span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">if not return error.</span></div></div>",
